@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18080
@memberToken = 替换为买家登录返回的token
@adminToken = 替换为管理员登录返回的token
@devKey = 替换为本地开发密钥

# 本文件为逐步手工演示；将响应中的ID和业务号填入后续请求。
# 所有金额均为整数分。不要把真实凭证保存或提交到仓库。


@addressId = 1
@skuId = 1
@couponId = 1
@fingerprint = 替换为试算返回的fingerprint
@orderNo = 替换为订单号
@paymentNo = 替换为支付单号

### 试算；不要客户端自行填入应付价格
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"addressId":"{{addressId}}","lines":[{"skuId":"{{skuId}}","quantity":2}],"couponId":"{{couponId}}"}

### 下单；同一键和相同请求重放返回相同订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Idempotency-Key: learning-order-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"checkout":{"addressId":"{{addressId}}","lines":[{"skuId":"{{skuId}}","quantity":2}],"couponId":"{{couponId}}"},"quoteFingerprint":"{{fingerprint}}","fromCart":true}

### 发起支付，202 表示异步受理
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderNo":"{{orderNo}}"}

### 等待返回 payParameters.mode=LOCAL_SIMULATION，再模拟付款
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 重复通知两次并注入一次投递失败，观察自动恢复
POST {{baseUrl}}/dev/v1/payments/{{paymentNo}}/success
X-Dev-Key: {{devKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"copies":2,"delaySeconds":0,"failures":1}

### 轮询订单直到 PAID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 仅对另一笔待付款订单执行取消；202 后轮询 CLOSED 或 PAID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderNo}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
